# Cloudflare Pages headers. Cross-origin isolation is REQUIRED for the TTS engine (spec 32): ONNX
# Runtime Web uses SharedArrayBuffer for multi-threaded wasm, which the browser only exposes when the
# document is cross-origin isolated. Without these, TTS still runs but single-threaded (much slower).
# (In dev these same headers come from vite.config.ts `server.headers`.)
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# The vendored ORT wasm + sentencepiece are content-stable; cache them hard.
/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
